  "_coats": "COATS (species.js coatDef): the BENGAL tiger mostly (the table's own); the SIBERIAN (Amur) tiger, 1.1x, paler and yellower, more white on the cheeks and belly; the WHITE tiger (the Bengal's leucistic form, blue-eyed, pink-nosed: the stripes stay dark)",
